  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "Kaz，“教授”准备的那座平台，情况怎么样？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "刚到时我都只能笑了。那感觉简直就是个满是海鸟的巨大鸟窝。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "锈和鸟粪总算清理掉了。基础结构没有受损，收拾一下完全能用。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_RUST_AND_DROPPINGS"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "这里原来是谁的？再怎么破，建造它也得花不少钱吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "看样子，这座平台是美国一所大学为研究<R=海洋温差发电,OTEC>而建的。锈迹斑斑的发电涡轮上还留着校名。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=海洋温差发电,OTEC>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 141,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_REFERENCE_PARTIAL"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "建造时当然也得到过政府和企业援助吧。可最终还是没能解决热效率问题，研究就此中止。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 120,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "KGB通过一家掩护企业，把这座废弃平台低价买了下来……大概就是这么回事吧？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 105,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "就算是通过掩护企业，KGB居然还能买下由美国资本建造的平台。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "是啊，那位“教授”确实很有一套。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "另外，这座平台还设计成能与同规格的平台<R=对接,JOINT>。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=对接,JOINT>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 76,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "也就是说，原计划就是不断扩建平台啊。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "就由我们来实现这个计划吧。招募人手、生产物资，把平台扩建成MSF的基地。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 102,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_COMPRESSES_DETAILS"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "拜托你了，Boss。",
